  "reviewNotes": "PDFpage9 and source full/front-back, top and low pedestal views inspected. Source399990tri/19999584bytes/maxZ42.632004. Tabletop native boundsX[-15.89850,15.84980],Y[-15.88085,15.86205], maximum decor radius15.91338mm. Source normal squares confirm floorY(X\u00b2.24866,Y\u00b2.05009) and tabletopX(X\u00b2.00503,Y\u00b2.40223). Continuous carved pedestal with four flared toes uses meridian grain; upper X boards and end cuts are physically recoloured to protect wood at metal boundaries.10 source head positions/normals fitted independently, top radii.565..665mm; solid radialShell cylinders follow each tilted face and measured wall depth. LOD data512 retains small heads. Quarter points\u00b18.75 hit the table, often on steep grooves, so use only four verified native\u00b114 corners atfloor25.39355..25.68179mm. A conservative16-gon radius16.35 has apothem16.0358mm, enclosing allsource decor while leaving those floorcorners outside. Check all10 cap colours/metal pixels, carved top, stem/toes, under-table clearance, source/blocker containment, stand points, render/LOD/shadow and both texture candidates before publication.",
